  "revert": "restoreFromBackup",
  "sources": [
    "Microsoft Learn: Microsoft Edge policy StartupBoostEnabled (\"Enable startup boost\"), Windows since Edge 88, REG_DWORD under SOFTWARE\\Policies\\Microsoft\\Edge; when disabled, Edge no longer preloads in the background at sign-in.",
    "There is no documented per-user setting outside of policies (the Edge setting lives in the browser's profile data); therefore a policy, with the required note \"Managed by your organization\"."
  ],
